# Copy to apps/web/.op/refs.env (gitignored) or export OP_ENVIRONMENT_ID in your shell.
#
# Create Environments in *your* 1Password account (Developer → Environments).
# Suggested display names (not shared project vaults to request access to):
#
#   Cutman (dev)  — your local `pnpm run dev` / Cursor Cloud Agents
#   cutman (prod) — your Cloudflare Workers Builds deploy (operators only)
#
# Populate required keys from apps/web/.dev.vars.example with your own Clerk
# credentials (APP_ENV, APP_ORIGIN, CLERK_*). The live pilot Sleeper league id
# (PILOT_SLEEPER_LEAGUE_ID) belongs in this Environment too. Cloudflare account /
# zone / D1 / KV IDs belong only in the deploy Environment (see
# apps/web/.deploy.env.example).
#
# Cursor Cloud Agents: do not copy apps/web/.op/refs.env or individual app secrets
# into Cursor. Set only OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN + OP_ENVIRONMENT_ID for *your*
# Environment — see README § Cursor Cloud Agents.
#
# Use the Environment UUID from 1Password, not the display name.
OP_ENVIRONMENT_ID=
